WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.671 --> 00:00:04.968
- [Gary] When I think about 
life, I think about so many

00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:07.854
different things that can 
factor into winning the day,

00:00:07.854 --> 00:00:09.419
winning the year,
winning the game.

00:00:09.419 --> 00:00:12.881
The five rules that I live 
by are confidence.

00:00:12.881 --> 00:00:15.605
Honestly, I think self-esteem
and confidence is the

00:00:15.605 --> 00:00:18.239
ultimate drug in society and
keeps most of us away

00:00:18.239 --> 00:00:20.089
from losing scenarios.

00:00:20.089 --> 00:00:22.637
Positive vibes only 
is a huge one for me.

00:00:22.637 --> 00:00:25.776
It's not "Positive vibes",
it's "Positive vibes only."

00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:28.192
And that's because too many 
people are keeping people

00:00:28.192 --> 00:00:31.230
around them that are 
bringing them down.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:34.466
They're allowing negative 
energy to dictate their outcome

00:00:34.466 --> 00:00:36.483
and I really believe that 
people have to cut out

00:00:36.483 --> 00:00:39.467
negative vibes 
in their environment.

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:41.154
Strengths over weaknesses 
is a big one for me.

00:00:41.154 --> 00:00:42.351
I preach this all the time.

00:00:42.351 --> 00:00:44.296
Triple down on what
you're good at.

00:00:44.296 --> 00:00:46.553
The world's gonna
tell you to fix this,

00:00:46.553 --> 00:00:47.996
you're not as good at that.

00:00:47.996 --> 00:00:49.183
I just don't believe in that.

00:00:49.183 --> 00:00:52.946
Figure out what you're best at 
and keep crafting that craft.

00:00:52.946 --> 00:00:54.261
Do it over and over and over.

00:00:54.261 --> 00:00:55.734
Legacy over currency.

00:00:55.734 --> 00:00:59.755
Understand that in 20, 30, 
40, 50 years from now

00:00:59.755 --> 00:01:01.968
you're going to care much 
more about what people

00:01:01.968 --> 00:01:03.330
thought of you, what your 
kids thought of you,

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.204
what the world thought of you.

00:01:04.204 --> 00:01:05.709
Did you do it the right way?

00:01:05.709 --> 00:01:07.087
The dollars, the products,

00:01:07.087 --> 00:01:08.788
the house and the car,

00:01:08.788 --> 00:01:11.388
whatever the monetary 
things that don't

00:01:11.388 --> 00:01:13.991
matter long term that 
you're striving for now.

00:01:13.991 --> 00:01:15.447
Don't worry about 
your bank account,

00:01:15.447 --> 00:01:18.112
worry about how many people 
show up to your funeral.

00:01:18.112 --> 00:01:19.208
And hustle, my friend.

00:01:19.208 --> 00:01:20.748
Number 5, hustle.

00:01:20.748 --> 00:01:22.505
If don't work hard,
you've lost.

00:01:22.505 --> 00:01:24.199
There's not a single 
winner on Earth

00:01:24.199 --> 00:01:26.522
that took it easy.

00:01:26.522 --> 00:01:28.117
There's not a single 
winner on Earth

00:01:28.117 --> 00:01:31.335
that didn't 
hustle 24/7/365.

